config PROFILE_RISCV64
    prompt "Target profile"
    type choice
    var ROSCONFIG_PROFILE
    value generic "Generic RISC-V"
    value profile_spacemit_k1 "SpacemiT K1 (Banana Pi BPI-F3)"
    value profile_starfive_jh7110 "StarFive JH7110 (Orange Pi RV)"
    default generic
    depends ARCH=riscv64
    help
      Generic builds the architecture-independent RISC-V target.

      SpacemiT K1 (Banana Pi BPI-F3) builds ReactOS.img as an SD card the K1
      boot ROM starts: U-Boot SPL, OpenSBI and U-Boot, which runs FreeLoader
      from the FAT boot partition.
      It compiles for the RVA22U64 profile, lets user-mode modules use
      misaligned scalar accesses, which the K1's X60 harts perform in
      hardware, and binds msvcrt to its vector (V) string routines.

      StarFive JH7110 (Orange Pi RV) builds ReactOS.img for a USB disk the
      firmware starts through UEFI, and JH7110-SD.img, an SD card that holds
      only U-Boot SPL, OpenSBI and U-Boot with a script that runs FreeLoader
      from the USB disk.
      It compiles for the RVA20U64 profile, which the JH7110's U74 harts
      implement.
